{"3920400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Land Of The Valiants", "steam_appid": 3920400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land of the Valiant</strong> is a multiplayer medieval fantasy world where survival, economy, and society are shaped by the players who inhabit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the fractured lands of <strong>Khalendor</strong>, the game blends <strong>RPG, survival, and life simulation</strong> in a persistent world built around scarcity, cooperation, and player-driven progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim land, build a home, grow crops, raise animals, gather resources, craft goods, trade with others, and take part in production chains that form the foundation of a living economy. Food, shelter, weather, and resources matter — survival is part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one truly lives alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players produce what others need. Farmers feed settlements. Craftsmen transform raw materials into valuable goods. Traders connect distant communities. Guilds organize people, resources, and territory. As the world grows, its economy and society grow with it — driven as much as possible by the actions of its players rather than artificial systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond civilization lies a dangerous fantasy world of exploration, combat, creatures, ancient ruins, and the remnants of a civilization lost during the <strong>Age of Shadows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single way to live in Khalendor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a farmer, craftsman, merchant, warrior, explorer, landowner — or simply find your own place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Build. Trade. Cooperate. Compete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Khalendor will become what its players make of it.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land of the Valiant</strong> is a multiplayer medieval fantasy world where survival, economy, and society are shaped by the players who inhabit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the fractured lands of <strong>Khalendor</strong>, the game blends <strong>RPG, survival, and life simulation</strong> in a persistent world built around scarcity, cooperation, and player-driven progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim land, build a home, grow crops, raise animals, gather resources, craft goods, trade with others, and take part in production chains that form the foundation of a living economy. Food, shelter, weather, and resources matter — survival is part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one truly lives alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players produce what others need. Farmers feed settlements. Craftsmen transform raw materials into valuable goods. Traders connect distant communities. Guilds organize people, resources, and territory. As the world grows, its economy and society grow with it — driven as much as possible by the actions of its players rather than artificial systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond civilization lies a dangerous fantasy world of exploration, combat, creatures, ancient ruins, and the remnants of a civilization lost during the <strong>Age of Shadows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single way to live in Khalendor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a farmer, craftsman, merchant, warrior, explorer, landowner — or simply find your own place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Build. Trade. Cooperate. Compete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Khalendor will become what its players make of it.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Land of the Valiant blends RPG, survival, and life simulation in a multiplayer medieval world. Build, produce, trade, and survive in a player-driven economy where Khalendor becomes what its inhabitants mak